---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Copy a running sandbox (memory, processes, disk) for parallel attempts

Usage: sbt fork [OPTIONS] <SANDBOX>

Arguments:
  <SANDBOX>
          Sandbox to copy

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --name <NAME>
          Name of the copy (default: <sandbox>-fork-<n>)

      --count <COUNT>
          Number of copies

          [default: 1]

  -h, --help
          Print help
